# A townsperson, look 0 (the paisano), 1919: a young Basque-born worker,
# about 30 (age 0.54), of medium build. A collarless off-white shirt, a
# dark bombacha, a red faja, a red neckerchief, a dark blue boina pulled
# down to one side, and alpargatas (canvas shoes on a rope sole). The game
# tints the shirt, bombacha, faja, neckerchief and boina per person (see
# crates/render/src/character/townsfolk.rs).
#
# Lines MakeHuman does not know (it warns and skips them) are read by
# tools/mh2gltf.py: piece (see ../README.md). Credits in ../CREDITS.md.
